This licence covers Swar's own source code only.

Swar downloads and runs third-party model weights that are not part of this
repository and are not covered by this licence. Each carries its own terms,
recorded with its pinned revision and checksum in `docs/models.md`:

  - Whisper small (`ggml-small-q5_1.bin`) — MIT, OpenAI
  - Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct GGUF — Apache-2.0, Alibaba Cloud
  - Parakeet TDT 0.6b v3 (sherpa-onnx int8 export) — the NVIDIA NeMo base
    model is CC-BY-4.0, but the export repository carries no explicit licence
    tag. Resolve this before redistributing the weights.

Vendored dependencies under `vendor/` keep the licences of their upstreams.
